 entitled to donor coverage benefits. No benefits are provided to the non- member transplant recipient. (v) If any organ or tissue is sold rather than donated to the enrollee, no benefits are payable for the purchase price of such organ or tissue;

Manipulative therapy is a covered medical expense but benefits shall not exceed $2,000 annually.

